    <mxCell id="key" value="&lt;b&gt;Not a database&lt;/b&gt;   there is no table, no migration, no index: the whole model is one JSON document written per run, so every entity below is a JSON object and every FK is a JSON pointer&#10;&lt;b&gt;Cardinality&lt;/b&gt;   1 ValidationRun has 3 LocationSummary, 27 BlockInstance, N CapabilityRef, N RulePathRef, 3 ConfigCheck, 1 RunSummary, and snapshots exactly 1 BaselineRecord&#10;&lt;b&gt;Baseline link&lt;/b&gt;   BaselineRecord is versioned in the repository, not in the report; the report copies the hash it compared against so an old report stays interpretable after the baseline moves&#10;&lt;b&gt;Invariant&lt;/b&gt;   defects + exclusions must equal the raw occurrence count, and by_bucket must sum to exclusions — a report that fails this reconciliation is itself a failure (see DISC-5)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="40" y="690" width="1090" height="100" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
